OL,3,GNEWSAMural showcasing 'community
OL,4,Adiversity' unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA colourful mural covering more than
OL,7,F200 sq m of wall alongside a riverbank
OL,8,Fhas been unveiled at a Sheffield
OL,9,Fbusiness park.
OL,11,FCreated by artist Zoe Genders, the
OL,12,Fmural took more than a month to
OL,13,Fcomplete and can be seen along Cutler's
OL,14,FWalk next to the River Sheaf in Heeley.
OL,16,FFeatured local landmarks were suggested
OL,17,Fin community workshops with local
OL,18,Fschools and community groups, with the
OL,19,Fneighbouring river, Heeley City Farm's
OL,20,Fresident peacock and the Madina Mosque
OL,21,Fincorporated in the design.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
