OL,3,GNEWSAMural showcasing 'community
OL,4,Adiversity' unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FGenders said the "fantastic" project at
OL,7,Fthe Sheaf Bank Business Park on Queen's
OL,8,FRoad had prompted a "heartwarming"
OL,9,Fresponse from the local community.
